{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2008-deet-science2-20","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2008,"subject":"chemistry","number":20,"points":null,"unitId":"organic_rxn","unitLabel":"유기 반응","topic":"주생성물·생성물·합성","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["organic_rxn","organic-analysis"],"stem":"다음은4-methylbiphenyl을출발물질로하여4-bromomethylbiphenyl을\n주생성물로합성하는<반응식>과<실험과정>이다.\n<반응식>\nNBS, (C6H5CO2)2\nCCl4\nBr\n<실험과정>\n(1) 50 mL 둥근바닥플라스크에4-methylbiphenyl(1.7 g, 10 mmol)을\n넣고CCl4(20 mL)로녹인후, NBS(N-bromosuccinimide, 1.8 g,\n10 mmol)와benzoyl peroxide(0.1 g, 0.4 mmol)를첨가\n하여잘저어주면서환류시킨다.\n(2) TLC에반응물, 벤조산및succinimide 이외의점(spot)이\n두개이상나타나기시작하면반응을멈춘다.\n(3) 반응혼합물을얼음수조에서냉각시킨후, 침전물을여과\n하여제거한다.\n(4) 여과액을감압증류하여용매를제거한후, 관크로마토\n그래피로생성물을분리한다.\n(5) 분광학자료를얻어주생성물을확인한다.\n이실험에대한설명으로적절하지않은것은?","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"(1)에서CCl4 대신톨루엔을용매로사용할수있다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":2,"text":"(1)에서benzoyl peroxide는라디칼개시제이다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]},{"number":3,"text":"(2)에서반응물이완전히없어지지않았더라도반응을멈추는 이유는과브롬화반응(overbromination) 생성물을최소화하기 위해서이다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t022","t023","t024"]},{"number":4,"text":"(3)에서제거된주침전물은succinimide이다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t025"]},{"number":5,"text":"주생성물의질량스펙트럼에서 m/e 값이246과248인피크의 세기는약1 : 1의비로나타난다.","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t026","t027","t028"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":771,"height":768,"region":0,"bbox":[14.355,47.948,308.4,307.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-deet-science2-20/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":55,"height":6,"region":0,"bbox":[177.955,377.148,22.0,2.4],"role":"